{"code":"336680","name":"탑런토탈솔루션","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"자동차부품","sector_desc":"완성차에 들어가는 부품 제조. 완성차 생산량과 전동화(EV) 전환 속도, 환율의 영향을 받습니다.","desc":"동사는 2024년 코스닥시장에 상장한 기업으로, 국내 종속회사로 탑런에이피솔루션과 탑런머티리얼솔루션을 보유하고 있음. 부품 부문에서 차량용 디스플레이 BLU, IVI, HUD 등 전장솔루션과 OLED부품, TV관련 부품 등 IT솔루션을 영위하고 있음. 동사는 중국, 베트남 등에 근거리 생산공장을 보유하여 즉시 대응 체계를 구축하고, 전공정 자동화 인라인을 통한 품질 확보로 글로벌 기업들과의 협력 관계를 강화하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-22","n_days":300,"close":2695.0,"open":2745.0,"high":2830.0,"low":2660.0,"volume":24164,"amount":65121980.0,"ret_1d":-3.75,"gap":-1.9643,"range_pct":6.308,"ret_5":-0.7366,"ret_20":-8.3333,"ret_60":4.4574,"ret_120":-31.5121,"ret_250":-33.6207,"ma20":2923.75,"ma60":2756.75,"ma120":2934.875,"ma200":3384.625,"close_vs_ma200":-20.3752,"close_vs_ma60":-2.24,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":151.0283,"r2_60":0.6589,"slope_120":-40.2052,"r2_120":0.2726,"slope_250":-45.3457,"r2_250":0.7417,"high52":5280.0,"low52":1721.0,"pos_52w":27.3672,"dd_52w":-48.9583,"mdd_1y":-57.2816,"atr14_pct":5.5924,"vol_ann_60":39.4819,"vol_avg20":19961.95,"vol_ratio20":1.2105,"vr5":0.8816,"vr20":0.628,"amount_avg5":48541386.0,"amount_avg20":58665335.5,"amount_avg60":53424768.75,"obv_chg20":-3.1908,"turnover_20":1.0199,"pv_eff_20":-8.1709,"rsi14":37.8817,"frgn_net_5":3922.0,"inst_net_5":25000.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.01,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0639,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0739,"frgn_net_20":1151.0,"inst_net_20":94079.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0029,"inst_net_20_pct":0.2403,"smart_net_20_pct":0.2433,"frgn_net_60":25721.0,"inst_net_60":153826.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0657,"inst_net_60_pct":0.393,"smart_net_60_pct":0.4587,"frgn_net_120":180253.0,"inst_net_120":127542.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.4605,"inst_net_120_pct":0.3258,"smart_net_120_pct":0.7863,"foreign_ratio":0.8,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.05,"smart_buy_streak":35,"op_income_q":3.0,"op_margin_q":0.1678,"op_qoq":106.25,"op_turnaround":1.0,"op_yoy":142.8571,"rev_yoy":47.7686,"op_trend_4q":-71.7557,"fin_period":"202606","roe":1.29,"debt_ratio":204.38,"per":44